  "business_rules": [
    "Deleted records (is_deleted = 1) should normally be excluded from reporting.",
    "created_date is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Use GST / price for monetary or quantity totals.",
    "Join to Factories, Factory Category, Factory Units through the foreign key columns to resolve names.",
    "FactoryProducts is defined in the EF Core model but was not found in the connected database, so it may not be deployed there."
